// Dialog :
"P373852493" "This doesn't look good for Rauscher. At a minimum, he's let his project get way out of hand. At worst, he's off on some crazy quest for power. We've got to find him, {VillainName}. If we let him get away, Ghost Widow may well take her frustration out on both of us."
// RandomFameString :
