// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3870826617" "If we don't find Special Operative Rauscher, Ghost Widow will have both our heads. Fortunately, I've got an idea of where he may be. Rauscher maintained a secondary lab, where he kept most of the ghosts his men had captured. Not a lot of people know about it. It'd be a good place for him to hole up if he suspects trouble - which he should. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Care to check it out?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P558872173" "Check out Rauscher's second lab"
// SendOffString :
"P2039697498" "I've already made my contingency plans, kid. If this thing goes sour, you're on your own against Ghost Widow."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3780063846" "Defeat Operative Fowler & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1266145156" "Have you found Rauscher yet?"

